# DS-0001 (image tag "latest"): intentionally ignored by policy. The base image
# is a rolling :latest on purpose so every build picks up the latest security
# fixes; pinning the base risks shipping an artifact without current fixes.
# Reproducibility comes from retaining every built image in the registry and
# deploying by digest, not from pinning the base.
DS-0001
